[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:87. A Car Crash]
[00:00.960]Lesson 87 | 第87课
[00:03.075]Is my car ready yet? | 我的车修好了吗？
[00:05.845]I don't know, sir. | 我不知道，先生。
[00:07.450]What's the license number of your car? | 您的车牌号码是多少？
[00:10.270]It's LFZ 312G. | 是LFZ 312G。
[00:14.760]When did you bring it to us? | 您是什么时候送来的？
[00:16.840]I brought it here three days ago. | 我三天前送来的。
[00:19.365]Ah, yes, I remember now. | 哦，对了，我现在想起来了。
[00:22.460]Have your mechanics finished yet? | 您的机械师修好了吗？
[00:25.090]No, they're still working on it. | 没有，他们还在修。
[00:27.390]Let's go into the garage and have a look at it. | 咱们到汽车间里看看吧。
[00:31.405]Isn't that your car? | 那不是您的车吗？
[00:34.660]Well, it was my car. | 嗯，那曾经是我的车。
[00:37.480]Didn't your wife have a crash? | 您太太不是出了车祸吗？
[00:40.010]That's right. | 对了。
[00:40.965]She drove it into a lamppost. | 她把车开到了灯柱上。
[00:43.705]Can your mechanics repair it? | 您的机械师能修好它吗？
[00:45.885]Well, they're trying to repair it, sir. | 嗯，他们正在努力修理，先生。
[00:49.090]But to tell you the truth, | 但是实话告诉您，
[00:50.980]you need a new car. | 您需要一辆新车了。